Description: This package implements the NILS approach to mode regression proposed in Oelker et al. (2015) and evaluation tools to access the performance compared to the mode regression of Kemp et al. (2012), median or mean regression. It is an extended, adapted and optimized rewrite of the unpublished code used in Oelker et al. (2015).
